[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3390227328","pull_request_review_id":4470095226,"id":3390227328,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7KEsOA","diff_hunk":"@@ -2043,8 +2037,9 @@ void GDScriptInstance::reload_members() {\n \n \t//pass the values to the new indices\n \tfor (KeyValue<StringName, GDScript::MemberInfo> &E : script->member_indices) {\n-\t\tif (member_indices_cache.has(E.key)) {\n-\t\t\tVariant value = members[member_indices_cache[E.key]];\n+\t\tconst GDScript::MemberInfo *old = script->old_member_indices.getptr(E.key);\n+\t\tif (old != nullptr) {","path":"modules/gdscript/gdscript.cpp","commit_id":"1de60ef255fa5255f10d5b0aae6061479f156a41","original_commit_id":"35449aaf99b19f44bbeef75bd1b89a5a774f9f4b","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'm a little concerned about the empty `old_member_indices` playing a dual role here. It might be empty because the class previously had no members, or because we made some mistake and the script is reloading at an unexpected time. Perhaps we should add an `is_reloading_members` flag and check its value at the appropriate points (here, at the beginning, and at the end of the reload)? Especially considering that this flag will now be part of `GDScript`, not `GDScriptInstance`.","created_at":"2026-06-10T17:26:13Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T19:07:46Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117438#discussion_r3390227328","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117438","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3390227328"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117438#discussion_r3390227328"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117438"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3390227328/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":2047,"original_line":2041,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":20,"position":20,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3390856273","pull_request_review_id":4470826549,"id":3390856273,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7KHFxR","diff_hunk":"@@ -2043,8 +2037,9 @@ void GDScriptInstance::reload_members() {\n \n \t//pass the values to the new indices\n \tfor (KeyValue<StringName, GDScript::MemberInfo> &E : script->member_indices) {\n-\t\tif (member_indices_cache.has(E.key)) {\n-\t\t\tVariant value = members[member_indices_cache[E.key]];\n+\t\tconst GDScript::MemberInfo *old = script->old_member_indices.getptr(E.key);\n+\t\tif (old != nullptr) {","path":"modules/gdscript/gdscript.cpp","commit_id":"1de60ef255fa5255f10d5b0aae6061479f156a41","original_commit_id":"35449aaf99b19f44bbeef75bd1b89a5a774f9f4b","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`GDScriptInstance::reload_members` is only in the callgraph of `GDScript::reload`. So I'd argue `GDScript::is_reloading` is already sufficient protection. We could add a `DEV_ASSERT(script->is_reloading)` to make this more obvious.\n\nI'm not exactly sure what you mean by empty array. This checks for the absence of values but not for a completely empty array. So basically we ignore members that did not exist before the reload and do not copy them over.\n\nAs a side note: There is a separate issue with this section: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119057","created_at":"2026-06-10T19:07:23Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T19:07:23Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117438#discussion_r3390856273","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117438","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3390856273"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117438#discussion_r3390856273"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117438"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.githu